principals are "alice", "bob", "unlisted".
resources are "data1", "data2", "unlisted".
actions are "read", "unlisted", "write".
roles are none.
state "available" initially false.
allow when principal is "alice" and resource is "data1" and action is "read" then set state "available" to not state "available".
allow when principal is "bob" and resource is "data2" and action is "write" then set state "available" to not state "available".
otherwise deny.
